### Verdict: CHERRY_PICKING

### Justification
The claim misattributes political donations to NBC News journalist Kristen Welker personally, when in fact the donations to Obama (~$20,000), Clinton ($2,100), and Biden ($3,300) were made by her parents, Julie and Harvey Welker, according to the [NY Post](https://nypost.com/2020/10/17/kristen-welker-next-debate-moderator-has-deep-democrat-ties/). While Welker was registered as a Democrat in Washington, DC in 2012 and Rhode Island in 2004, her current voter registration status is unconfirmed, making the claim that she "is registered as a Democrat" unsupported. The assertion that her family spent Christmas with the Obamas at the White House is accurate, as they did celebrate Christmas there in 2012. The claim thus mixes verifiable facts (the Christmas visit, past Democratic registration, and family donations) with a misleading attribution of those donations directly to Welker herself, creating a distorted impression of her political activity.